ity with them police say the  suspect in atlanta not only admitted to  carrying out the shootings  but may have planned to drive to florida  to carry out more attacks  whatever his motive his alleged actions  have left the community already on edge  reeling jackson cross go global news  washington  the irish band u2 took a trip back in  time for st patrick's day  kicking up a virtual tour they  re-released this homecoming concert from  2001.  we're back in a moment  [Music]  canada says iran's final report on the  downing of ukraine airlines flight 752  is incomplete iran's civil aviation  authority blames human error repeating  what the country's military said when  the jet was shot down in january 2020  all 176 crew and passengers were killed  including 138 people with ties to canada  the canadian government has the report  and says it makes no attempt to answer  critical questions  about what truly happened ottawa plans  to release the results  of its own investigation a symbolic  victory tonight for same-sex couples in  japan  a district court has ruled the  government's ban on same-sex marriages  is unconstitutional this is japan's  first ruling on the legality of same-sex  unions  it has no immediate effect but it is  expected to bolster efforts for  legalization  japan's constitution defines marriage as  one of mutual consent about  sexes same-sex couples have no parental  rights to any children  and can't inherit their partner's assets  japan is the only g7 nation that doesn't  fully  recognize same-sex partnerships  twice unlucky up next st patrick's day  jigs don't jive with the pandemic  in honor of saint patty's day folks in  dublin were treated to aerial artistry  more than 500 drones synchronized to  form shamrocks and celtic art  the orchestra of lights was produced to  offer some hope and happiness to people  in ireland  and around the world this is the second  year in a row that the annual parade  had to be cancelled bars and pubs in  canada  aren't